<h1>optimal</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
(1) A solution to an <a href="optimization.html"><em>optimization problem</em></a> which has the minimum (or maximum) value of the <a href="objective.html"><em>objective function</em></a>.  (2) The time, space, resource, etc. <a href="complexity.html"><em>complexity</em></a> of an <a href="algorithm.html"><em>algorithm</em></a> which matches the best known <a href="lowerbound.html"><em>lower bound</em></a> of a problem.
</p>


<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorSKS">SKS</a></p>

<hr>

